    "name": "Coinbase Advanced Trade Accounts Balances API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Coinbase Advanced Trade API provides programmatic access to advanced trading features on the Coinbase platform. Developers can automate market, limit, and stop-limit orders, manage portfolios, retrieve real-time and historical market data, and monitor fees. The REST API is available at api.coinbase.com/api/v3/brokerage and supports authenticated access using API keys with HMAC SHA-256 signatures. Public market data endpoints do not require authentication.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Coinbase Developer Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
